 upper lateral quadrant of the breast  10 o clock   In addition there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm cavity filled with yellow gelatinous material  0 5cm posterior to the nipple  and 5 0cm away from the closest posterior margin  designated second biopsy cavity  A well circumscribed  rubbery nodule is present 0 8cm away from the anterior margin  The remainder of the breast parenchyma consists of yellow fibrofatty tissue and is grossly unremarkable  Sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest posterior margin to first biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest anterior margin to first biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   First biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Radial section of posterior margin to second biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior margin of second biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Second biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Unremarkable parenchyma  A 15  Rubbery nodule  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right mastectomy skin   is a REMOVED_DATE x 3 8cm triangular piece of skin  excised to a depth of 1 5cm  with a tan and wrinkled skin surface  and unremarkable adipose tissue resection margin  In addition there is a 6 0cm in diameter 0 8cm in thickness ring of skin  excised to a depth of 0 8cm  with a unremarkable skin surface  and adipose resection margin  Representative sections of each piece of tissue are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  SKIN  RIGHT CHEST   EXCISION  report_end  , Negative.
