ive section is frozen as FX 1 and resubmitted  SECTION CODES  A C  Remainder of nodule  B  Frozen Section  1  resubmitted  D  Adjacent breast  E  Medial aspect of specimen  F  Lateral aspect of specimen  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast re excision   are two fragments of fibrofatty breast tissue  One has a small ellipse of skin which measures REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  The piece with the ellipse measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  The other piece measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  Four small surgical sutures and a small staple are removed from the skin ellipse  The center of the ellipse on further inspection is a small incision site which runs the length of the skin ellipse  The ellipse of the skin submitted as follows  tips in G  body in H and I  The rest of the breast tissue is inked black  serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes J L  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left leg lesion   is a ellipse of skin which measures REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm and is excised to a depth of 1 0cm  In the center of the ellipse there are two small papillary lesions which both appear top be greater than 0 3cm from either lateral margin and greater than 0 4cm from either axilla margin  The resection margins are inked black  There is a stitch on the ellipse designating the 12 o clock side  The 12 to 6 o clock side is over inked blue  The tips are submitted 12 o clock in M  6 o clock in N and body in O  Gross Description by  SAMANTHA J  PULLIAM  MD Resident  JEROME T  O CONNELL JR   MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION   INVASIVE CARCINOMA PRESENT AT RESECTION MARGIN  O R  Resident  SAMANTHA J  PULLIAM  MD O R  Diagnosis by  EDI BROGI  MD  PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  COMP  BREAST HEALTH CENTER REPORTS TO  Michele A